    {
      "subId": "1112206",
      "subQuestName": "Save the ambushed scholar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112207",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the scholar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111220701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111220701": {
            "id": "111220701",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wanyu",
            "text": "Those monsters were so aggressive — they must have noticed me walking through! Before I knew it they were all over me... Thank you all for saving me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220702"
            ]
          },
          "111220702": {
            "id": "111220702",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wanyu",
            "text": "My name is Wanyu, I belong to Liyue's Shenglu Hall. I head up our human culture and civilization research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220703"
            ]
          },
          "111220703": {
            "id": "111220703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? You sure you're not... a miner?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220704"
            ]
          },
          "111220704": {
            "id": "111220704",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wanyu",
            "text": "A miner?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220705"
            ]
          },
          "111220705": {
            "id": "111220705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah. We're looking for a group of four strong fellas carrying mining equipment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220706"
            ]
          },
          "111220706": {
            "id": "111220706",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wanyu",
            "text": "I... I think I saw those people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220707"
            ]
          },
          "111220707": {
            "id": "111220707",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220708"
            ]
          },
          "111220708": {
            "id": "111220708",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wanyu",
            "text": "Yes. I set off from Nantianmen the day before yesterday heading for Lingju Pass. About halfway there I came across some people — a few men and a child.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220709"
            ]
          },
          "111220709": {
            "id": "111220709",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can you be a bit more specific?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220710"
            ]
          },
          "111220710": {
            "id": "111220710",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wanyu",
            "text": "I was in a hurry, I didn't get a good look. I'm afraid I'm not even sure what they looked like... apologies.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220711"
            ]
          },
          "111220711": {
            "id": "111220711",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "I think that's all we needed to hear. Thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220712"
            ]
          },
          "111220712": {
            "id": "111220712",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wanyu",
            "text": "I hope it's useful to you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220713"
            ]
          },
          "111220713": {
            "id": "111220713",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wanyu",
            "text": "I'd better get going, there's a conference I need to attend. Again, thank you all for your help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220714"
            ]
          },
          "111220714": {
            "id": "111220714",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "According to this scholar, the miners were heading for Nantianmen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220715"
            ]
          },
          "111220715": {
            "id": "111220715",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "Can we be absolutely sure that it was the men that we're looking for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220716"
            ]
          },
          "111220716": {
            "id": "111220716",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A child with a group of adults! Sounds pretty close to Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220717"
            ]
          },
          "111220717": {
            "id": "111220717",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It could easily have been a different group.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220718"
            ]
          },
          "111220718": {
            "id": "111220718",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh... but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220719"
            ]
          },
          "111220719": {
            "id": "111220719",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "Hey, perhaps that rock over there can tell us more!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220720"
            ]
          },
          "111220720": {
            "id": "111220720",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aha! Paimon nearly forgot about our secret weapon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220721"
            ]
          },
          "111220721": {
            "id": "111220721",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "It looks promising, I'll do my best.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220722"
            ]
          },
          "111220722": {
            "id": "111220722",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220723"
            ]
          },
          "111220723": {
            "id": "111220723",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220724"
            ]
          },
          "111220724": {
            "id": "111220724",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "It's the same group alright. They followed this road.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220725"
            ]
          },
          "111220725": {
            "id": "111220725",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Haha, Mr. Kun Jun, your stone-seeing is something I won't forget in a hurry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220726"
            ]
          },
          "111220726": {
            "id": "111220726",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "I suppose it is an asset, though I rarely find a use for it. But praise from Mr. Zhongli is high praise indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220727"
            ]
          },
          "111220727": {
            "id": "111220727",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's a good thing we brought our \"Kun Jun compass\" along! We would've lost all sense of direction a long time ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220728"
            ]
          },
          "111220728": {
            "id": "111220728",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "Hahaha, you think so? I guess it's been a worthwhile trip then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220729"
            ]
          },
          "111220729": {
            "id": "111220729",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "It feels like... like we're cracking a criminal case. It's a lot of fun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220730"
            ]
          },
          "111220730": {
            "id": "111220730",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Be that as it may, we would do well to keep our guards high.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220731"
            ]
          },
          "111220731": {
            "id": "111220731",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Four fully-grown men in a trance-like state... walking ceaselessly day and night... over hills and mountains... led by a child... This is no ordinary incident.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220732"
            ]
          },
          "111220732": {
            "id": "111220732",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "Oh! You're quite right, Mr. Zhongli. We should have our wits about us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220733"
            ]
          },
          "111220733": {
            "id": "111220733",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "That's not all. Our scholar was attacked by Geovishap Hatchlings, but the level of aggression they exhibited was... unusual.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220734"
            ]
          },
          "111220734": {
            "id": "111220734",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "We have encountered many clues along the way. So far they've pointed us in the right direction.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220735"
            ]
          },
          "111220735": {
            "id": "111220735",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Hmm, the miners headed in the direction of Nantianmen the day before yesterday. From here they would have had to navigate a perilous mountain road. If their destination is indeed Nantianmen, we should be able to catch up with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220736"
            ]
          },
          "111220736": {
            "id": "111220736",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Great! No time to lose!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220737"
            ]
          },
          "111220737": {
            "id": "111220737",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "I left a mark in the vicinity just now. If Uncle Dai does pass through here, it should guide him to us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220738"
            ]
          },
          "111220738": {
            "id": "111220738",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Clever thinking! A classic Zhongli move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112208",
      "subQuestName": "Head to Nantianmen and look for clues",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111220802"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111220802": {
            "id": "111220802",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "There's a basket lying here too... This must be one of the miners.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220803"
            ]
          },
          "111220803": {
            "id": "111220803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! Hello? Can you hear us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220804"
            ]
          },
          "111220804": {
            "id": "111220804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Judging by his appearance, he must have collapsed from exhaustion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220805"
            ]
          },
          "111220805": {
            "id": "111220805",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Should we wake him up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220806"
            ]
          },
          "111220806": {
            "id": "111220806",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Miner",
            "text": "I can... I can still dig...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220807"
            ]
          },
          "111220807": {
            "id": "111220807",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*gasp* Sounds like he's whispering something...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220810"
            ]
          },
          "111220810": {
            "id": "111220810",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "It seems that he thinks he still has work to do. Something's not right.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220811"
            ]
          },
          "111220811": {
            "id": "111220811",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "There's a camp nearby. We should take him there and monitor his condition before deciding our next move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112209",
      "subQuestName": "Take the miner to a nearby camp to rest",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111220901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111220901": {
            "id": "111220901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220902"
            ]
          },
          "111220902": {
            "id": "111220902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How is he? H—He won't die, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220903"
            ]
          },
          "111220903": {
            "id": "111220903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "He's worked himself into a stupor. Thankfully, he's not in serious danger.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220904"
            ]
          },
          "111220904": {
            "id": "111220904",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How did he get so exhausted?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220905"
            ]
          },
          "111220905": {
            "id": "111220905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon heard him talking about digging for something. Did he dig himself into this state?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220906"
            ]
          },
          "111220906": {
            "id": "111220906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "It's certainly a possibility.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220909"
            ]
          },
          "111220909": {
            "id": "111220909",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "Hm? It looks like there's something in his pocket...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220910"
            ]
          },
          "111220910": {
            "id": "111220910",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "Are these... ore fragments?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220911"
            ]
          },
          "111220911": {
            "id": "111220911",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220912"
            ]
          },
          "111220912": {
            "id": "111220912",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "I just witnessed the memories within these ore fragments. This person brought these fragments out of the mine. He's one of the four that we're searching for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220913"
            ]
          },
          "111220913": {
            "id": "111220913",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "How he came to be here is what we need to understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220914"
            ]
          },
          "111220914": {
            "id": "111220914",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So he was kidnapped, and then... abandoned here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220915"
            ]
          },
          "111220915": {
            "id": "111220915",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But if they didn't need him, why bring him all the way out here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220916"
            ]
          },
          "111220916": {
            "id": "111220916",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Unless something happened... something that led him to fall behind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220917"
            ]
          },
          "111220917": {
            "id": "111220917",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220918"
            ]
          },
          "111220918": {
            "id": "111220918",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's had enough! This is too mysterious!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220919"
            ]
          },
          "111220919": {
            "id": "111220919",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "Oh! Wait a moment! Seeing these fragments has jogged my memory — I have something for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220920"
            ]
          },
          "111220920": {
            "id": "111220920",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What is it? Ooh! Is it a present?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220921"
            ]
          },
          "111220921": {
            "id": "111220921",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Something... for us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220922"
            ]
          },
          "111220922": {
            "id": "111220922",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "As I mentioned, before I met Uncle Dai I was in a daze. After setting out with you on this case, it feels like a fog is lifting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220923"
            ]
          },
          "111220923": {
            "id": "111220923",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "I was so happy when Uncle Dai enlisted you to help. I would never have managed to track down these clues by myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220924"
            ]
          },
          "111220924": {
            "id": "111220924",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kun Jun",
            "text": "These are some crystals that I bought from the market. Not any old crystals mind you — this purity is extraordinarily rare! One for each of you. A memory, if you will.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220925"
            ]
          },
          "111220925": {
            "id": "111220925",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's beautiful... Oh — and the colors change as you turn it! It's like a different crystal from each angle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
